        "progress": "Mapped the recursive production graph and replaced outward ownership with neutral core ports: SlopError moved to core/errors; index schemas/DTOs/formatters to core/db-index; StorageBackend plus event/query/tolerant-read DTOs to core/storage-contract. Compatibility re-exports preserve repo/storage/CLI surfaces. Ticket/session domain no longer imports repo, storage, or CLI; typecheck passes and the recursive graph now has zero SCC cycles (previously repo/db-index and repo/tickets formed one)."
